    <briefdescription>
<para>Sandbox manifest for DLL step plugin loading. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements §Phase 3 DLL step plugin sandbox (ROADMAP Q3 2026). Before <computeroutput>loadStepPlugin()</computeroutput> dlopen()s any library, the manifest is validated:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>The library path must be under one of the <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_step_plugin_manifest_1a68fba050d5c17e327decae8ca1a39e52" kindref="member">allowed_paths</ref></computeroutput> prefixes.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_step_plugin_manifest_1a0bb350716bd1fd3445ba596dc2cc72b3" kindref="member">allowed_mime_types</ref></computeroutput> is non-empty, the plugin&apos;s reported MIME type (declared in the manifest, read from a sidecar <computeroutput>.manifest.json</computeroutput> file next to the .so) must be in the allowed set.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>An empty <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_step_plugin_manifest" kindref="compound">StepPluginManifest</ref></computeroutput> (default) is permissive — all paths and MIME types are accepted (backwards compatibility). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
